  "steps": [
    "Line up tens and ones, then subtract the ONES first.",
    "If the top ones digit is too small, BORROW a ten from the tens place!",
    "Example: 42 - 17 → can't do 2 - 7, so borrow: 12 - 7 = 5, then 3 - 1 = 2 → 25.",
    "Check your answer by adding back: 25 + 17 = 42 ✓"
  ],
